# Generated repo structure — test fixtures in THIS repo only (ADR-009 D5).
# These roots are what the commands build in a consuming repo. Here they are
# scratch: running /fw-new, /fw-new-ops-record, /fw-new-kb-domain or
# /fw-new-workspace during development creates them, and none of it is real.
# The live board is project-hub/work/ until the crossover at graduation.
#
# workspaces/framework/ is the EXCEPTION — it is the new framework's source
# tree, not generated output, and is tracked.
/kanban/
/operations/
/kb/
/workspaces/*
!/workspaces/framework/
